            <div class="row author-bio-section-thumbnail" data-author-slug="angela-betsaida-laguipo"><div class="authorImage col-xs-12 col-md-2"><img src="https://d2jx2rerrg6sh3.cloudfront.net/pics/team2/angela-b-laguipo-thumb.jpg" alt="Angela Betsaida B. Laguipo"/></div><div class="authorInfo col-xs-12 col-md-10"><p>Written by</p><h3><a href="https://www.news-medical.net/medical/authors/angela-betsaida-laguipo">Angela Betsaida B. Laguipo</a></h3><p>Angela is a nurse by profession and a writer by heart. She graduated with honors (Cum Laude) for her Bachelor of Nursing degree at the University of Baguio, Philippines. She is currently completing her Master&#39;s Degree where she specialized in Maternal and Child Nursing and worked as a clinical instructor and educator in the School of Nursing at the University of Baguio.</p></div></div>

            
